sequenceDiagram
  participant A1 as Browser user
  participant C14 as UI script
  participant C3 as SessionAuthMiddleware
  participant C4 as SessionStore
  participant C6 as AuthController
  participant C18 as DemoUser (config)
  participant C19 as UserSession
  participant C7 as InvoicesController
  participant C5 as RequireRole filter
  participant C8 as ApprovalsController
  participant C10 as ApprovalService
  participant C15 as Invoice
  participant C11 as IInvoiceRepository
  participant C12 as InMemoryInvoiceRepository
  A1->>C14: sign in
  C14->>C6: S1: POST /api/auth/login (middleware skips this path)
  C6->>C18: S2: username and password matched to configured users, 401 if none
  C6->>C19: S3: new UserSession(username, role), role copied from DemoUser
  C6->>C4: S4: session created
  C14->>C3: S5: POST /api/invoices/id/submit with Bearer token
  C3->>C4: S6: token lookup, 401 if no session
  C3->>C7: S7: any signed-in role may submit
  Note over C3,C7: Framework routing between middleware and controller omitted
  C7->>C10: S8: Submit(id) via Handle
  C10->>C11: S9: invoice must be Draft else 409, set PendingApproval, Update
  C14->>C3: S10: POST /api/approvals/id/approve or reject
  C3->>C4: S11: token validation, 401 if invalid
  C3->>C5: S12: role must be Approver or Admin else 403
  C5->>C8: S13: allowed
  C8->>C10: S14: Approve(id, username) or Reject(id, username, reason)
  C10->>C10: S15: blank reject reason throws, mapped to 400
  C10->>C11: S16: invoice must be PendingApproval else 409, 404 if missing
  C10->>C15: S17: set Status Approved or Rejected, DecidedBy, DecidedAt, DecisionNote
  C10->>C11: S18: Update(invoice)
  C11->>C12: S19: replaces list entry under lock
  C8-->>C14: S20: 200 with invoice JSON
